course: dictionary
lesson: 15179
title: Sculptor: an artist who makes sculptures
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A sculptor is an artist who makes sculptures. A sculpture is a figure or shape that is carved from stone or wood, or made from clay, metal or other materials. The ending -or often shows a person who does a job, like a sailor or a actor.
explain: «The sculptor carved a horse from a block of white marble.» The clues are carved, and a block of marble. Carving means cutting away bits until the shape appears, so a sculptor works with their hands on a material.
explain: «My aunt is a sculptor, and she makes shapes out of clay.» Sculptors do not only carve stone. They can also press, build and shape soft materials such as clay, or work with metal.
fact: A sculptor is an artist who makes sculptures.
fact: Sculptures can be carved from stone or wood, or made from clay, metal or other materials.
fact: «Sculptor» is a noun, and its plural is «sculptors».
fact: In art lessons you may learn about famous sculptors such as Michelangelo, Barbara Hepworth and Henry Moore.
fact: Famous statues made by sculptors can tell us about the past.
exercise: «The sculptor carved a horse from a block of white marble.» What is a sculptor? | A teacher of music | A builder who lays bricks | A person who sells paintings in a shop | *An artist who makes sculptures
exercise: Which materials can a sculptor use? | Music and sound | Only paper and pencil | Sunlight and water | *Stone, wood, clay or metal
exercise: «Michelangelo was a famous sculptor.» Find and copy the word that names a job. | was | Michelangelo | *sculptor | famous
test: «The famous sculptor's statue stands in the town square.» What does sculptor mean here? | A person who cuts hair | *An artist who makes figures or shapes | A builder of roads | A singer in a choir
test: «The sculptor shaped the wet clay with her thumbs.» What might a sculptor be making? | A map of the town | *A shape or figure from clay | A cake for a party | A song for the school choir
exam: «My aunt is a sculptor, and she makes shapes out of clay.» Which word tells you the aunt is an artist? | makes | shapes | clay | *sculptor
